  "statement": "I appreciate the emphasis on maintaining a maximum borrowing limit for ethical compliance and safety. However, I believe EFF-02's proposal for up to 10 simultaneous borrow operations is essential for optimizing resource utilization. I propose a synthesis where we maintain the max borrowing limit at 5 books but explore options to optimize the borrowing process, such as increasing the efficiency of the borrowing operations through improved system performance. Additionally, I support the consolidation of SAF-02 and EFF-05 into a single notification requirement to reduce redundancy and enhance efficiency.",
